+## Design
+- `Equipment` gains optional `hourlyPrice`; `addEquipment` validates and stores it.
+- `period()` parses instants (ms) with a shared ISO check; if end-start < DAY_MS, both must be on the hour; otherwise both must be midnight (existing rule).
